  <item>
    <title>Vol6-留园 如何看懂一座苏州园林</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66a8e2527349f7a5579c4517</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66a8e2527349f7a5579c4517</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 30 Jul 2024 12:53:37 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本集内容我们将带大家来到四大名园之一的留园，这也是我个人最爱的一座园子。</span></p><p><span>拙政园虽久负盛名，但每次去都人满为患。而留园拥挤适度，整个园子虽只有拙政园一半大，但仍能在这27亩地之间感受到三代主人用细节巧思做出所留下的痕迹。</span></p><p><span>出发点：留园入口处</span></p><p><span>留园门票价格：成人55元 儿童/学生/老人（60-69）半价</span></p><p><span>点击可查看</span><a href="https://kdocs.cn/l/cahhPRU5Pr4Z" data-url="https://kdocs.cn/l/cahhPRU5Pr4Z"><span>留园浏览地图PDF</span></a><span>，方便您的游览</span></p><p><span>如果打不开链接可从</span><a href="https://pan.baidu.com/s/1R9dwk1eXTJ1toNwUWhp12g?pwd=tm2e" data-url="https://pan.baidu.com/s/1R9dwk1eXTJ1toNwUWhp12g?pwd=tm2e"><span>百度云网盘</span></a><span>下载查看</span></p><p><span>留园地图：</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp_0vSIfFhVaaRO2-P7OsWOG5_sn.jpg"></figure><p><span>时间节点：</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="85">1:25</a> 吴下名园</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="266">4:26</a> 蟹眼天井</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="290">4:50</a> 留园的三任主人</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="287">4:47</a> 留园牌匾</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="796">13:16</a> 长留天地间</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="826">13:46</a> 六扇漏窗</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="860">14:20</a> 古木交柯</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="914">15:14</a> 绿荫</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1245">20:45</a> 玉女峰</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1275">21:15</a> 一梯云</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1345">22:25</a> 涵碧山房</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1560">26:00</a> 溪山深秀</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1590">26:30</a> 此处有一个小口误</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1661">27:41</a> 奉橘帖</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1742">29:02</a> 闻木樨香轩</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1871">31:11</a> 簖霞峰</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1932">32:12</a> 可亭</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1970">32:50</a> 明瑟楼</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2218">36:58</a> 自在处（远翠阁）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2298">38:18</a> 青石花台</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2357">39:17</a> 小蓬莱</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2403">40:03</a> 濠濮亭</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2535">42:15</a> 曲溪</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2578">42:58</a> 奎宿峰</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2637">43:57</a> 书条石</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2730">45:30</a> 五峰仙馆</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2950">49:10</a> 大理石屏风</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3230">53:50</a> 静中观</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3180">53:00</a> 汲古得绠处</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3250">54:10</a> 揖峰轩</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3430">57:10</a> 东园</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3448">57:28</a> 干霄峰</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3466">57:46</a> 洞天一碧</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3647">60:47</a> 鹤所</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3669">61:09</a> 涩浪</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4147">69:07</a> 东山丝竹</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4274">71:14</a> 奇石寿太古</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4414">73:34</a> 林泉耆硕之馆</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4440">74:00</a> 冠云峰</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4724">78:44</a> 贮云庵</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4793">79:53</a> 冠云楼的鱼化石</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4917">81:57</a> 孩儿莲</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-t