  <item>
    <title>Vol5.城市网红了 然后呢？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/669db4608fcadceb90f1dbac</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">669db4608fcadceb90f1dbac</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 22 Jul 2024 01:22:40 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>随着2023年后旅游的大爆发，各大网红和旅游城市重新涌入了大量的游客。但城市网红化的当下，旅游又充斥着各种奇怪又好玩的现象，今天就和大家小小的吐槽一下我看到的一些现象。</span></p><span></span><p><span>同时这也是一期正式的跟大家打招呼的内容，跟大家介绍一下录制《声动》的初衷，以及我们之后的一些计划～</span></p><span></span><p><span>录制花絮：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FopURNAeDx9sL3-2SwQqJ8WBGA2B.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>平江图</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlLEcx6gZlW4B6MklGDLmhE5i0cz.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>留园花窗</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fqv8VRCiLfhFNLiEw2m2j9Y99Mn_.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="18">00:18</a> 和大家正式打个招呼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">01:00</a> 一期b站视频之后的灵感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="188">03:08</a> 平江路上违和的簪花</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="390">06:30</a> 不要随地大小照</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="477">07:57</a> just避雷</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="565">09:25</a> 最抽象的避雷贴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="770">12:50</a> 江浙沪为什么没有现象级网红</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1250">20:50</a> 做攻略分享</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1740">29:00</a> 《声动》的节目现状</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1813">30:13</a> 第一季内容</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1908">31:48</a> 之后的内容企划</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1960">32:40</a> 苏州的推荐</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lndV8Y27J63sw0I_l-hPgekDnL8M.m4a" length="54115829" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:37:17</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqFCe4UodCYQ_Z_LpbyzgqPSe2UK.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol4.平江路 支巷里似乎更有趣</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/669133f68fcadceb90e59e40</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">669133f68fcadceb90e59e40</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 12 Jul 2024 22:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>今天我们要带大家游览的是苏州最火的步行街——平江路，但是我们会带您绕开人声鼎沸的主街，走进静谧的支巷，最终到达一座处处秀恩爱的园林-耦园。我们将用90分钟的时间带大家感受这平江路支巷中丰富的人文气息。</span></p><p><strong><span>希望大家多多点赞 转发 收藏！！！</span></strong></p><p><span>游览起点：大儒巷-迎晓里</span></p><p><span>点击可查看</span><a href="https://kdocs.cn/l/crP3jfeFG3iJ" data-url="https://kdocs.cn/l/crP3jfeFG3iJ"><span>平江路耦园图片PDF</span></a><span>，方便您的游览</span></p><p><span>如果打不开链接可从</span><a href="https://pan.baidu.com/s/1nP6zTHCvE40_XcPYbHSrJg?pwd=c8h9" data-url="https://pan.baidu.com/s/1nP6zTHCvE40_XcPYbHSrJg?pwd=c8h9"><span>百度云网盘</span></a><span>下载查看</span></p><p><span>地图：</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkCO2HjtXbQCogcDhNn9lXTdUem1.jpg"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj_du8QdZhpkfrADDHJyFB9bzV1n.jpg"></figure><p><span>时间点：</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="45">00:45</a> 迎晓里</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="230">03:50</a> 韩崇故居</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="285">04:45</a> 安徽会馆</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="347">05:47</a> 惠荫园</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="604">10:04</a> 探花书房</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="823">13:43</a> 旧居</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="872">14:32</a> 祯彩堂</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="990">16:30</a> 郭家桥</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1050">17:30</a> 丁氏义庄</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1160">19:20</a> 洪钧故居</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1282">21:22</a> 钱宅</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1440">24:00</a> 方嘉漠故居</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1530">25:30</a> 黄丕烈藏书楼</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1708">28:28</a> 叶圣陶私塾旧址</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1750">29:10</a> 顾家花园</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1805">30:05</a> 苏肇冰故居</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1940">32:20</a> 鹿人画廊</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1982">33:02</a> 青石桥</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2040">34:00</a> 卫道观前潘宅</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2105">35:05</a> 苏州城建博物馆</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2330">38:50</a> 礼耕堂</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2597">43:17</a> 混堂巷</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2611">43:31</a> 贞节牌坊</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2663">44:23</a> 杨宅</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2806">46:46</a> 猛将弄</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3000">50:00</a> 双井</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3170">52:50</a> 偕隐双山</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3272">54:32</a> 载酒堂</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3323">55:23</a> 厚德载物</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3357">55:57</a> 西花园入口</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3384">56:24</a> 鹤寿亭</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3441">57:21</a> 瓶生三戟</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3487">58:07</a> 织帘老屋</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3580">59:40</a> 藏书楼</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3638">60:38</a> 月亮花窗</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3698">61:38</a> 诗酒联欢</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3833">63:53</a> 书条石</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3930">65:30</a> 无俗韵轩</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4104">68:24</a> 枕波双隐</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4173">69:33</a> 藤花舫</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4252">70:52</a> 城曲草堂</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="437