    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>今天我们要带大家游览的是苏州城的地标——虎丘。我们将用90分钟的时间带大家细细品味这吴中第一名胜。</span></p><span></span><p><span>游览起点：望山桥</span></p><span></span><p><span>ps：最近苏州地铁六号线开通了，可直达虎丘，成人门票70元</span></p><span></span><p><br></p><span></span><p><span>点击可查看</span><a href="https://kdocs.cn/l/ckM1wfHQqE6W" data-url="https://kdocs.cn/l/ckM1wfHQqE6W"><span>虎丘景点图片PDF</span></a><span>，方便您的游览</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果打不开链接可从</span><a href="https://pan.baidu.com/s/1jNXtv7EsIl6GBh8h_nBE-g?pwd=chay" data-url="https://pan.baidu.com/s/1jNXtv7EsIl6GBh8h_nBE-g?pwd=chay"><span>百度云网盘</span></a><span>下载查看</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ForwGkakoYPZpbsBCdsvtjP-atBW.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>时间节点：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">01:00</a> 望门桥</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="505">08:25</a> 狸猫 </span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="530">08:50</a> 虎阜禅寺</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="555">09:15</a> 勒石永禁虎丘染坊碑记</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="645">10:45</a> 碑廊</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="693">11:33</a> 吴中第一山</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="750">12:30</a> 断梁殿</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="848">14:08</a> 大吴胜壤</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="972">16:12</a> 拥翠山庄</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1063">17:43</a> 抱瓮轩</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1198">19:58</a> 湖石阶梯</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1270">21:10</a> 月驾轩</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1392">23:12</a> 海涌峰</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1430">23:50</a> 灵澜精舍</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1515">25:15</a> 送青簃</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1670">27:50</a> 憨憨泉</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1815">30:15</a> 试剑石</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2030">33:50</a> 枕石</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2254">37:34</a> 古真娘墓</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2300">38:20</a> 香魂</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2390">39:50</a> 千人石</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2485">41:25</a> 经幢</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2503">41:43</a> 般若波罗密经幢</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2568">42:48</a> 生公讲台</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2665">44:25</a> 点头</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2693">44:53</a> 二仙亭</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2940">49:00</a> 虎丘剑池</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3191">53:11</a> 可中亭</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3218">53:38</a> 第三泉</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3330">55:30</a> 入解脱门</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3380">56:20</a> 陈公桥（双井桥）</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3622">60:22</a> 虎丘塔</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4200">70:00</a> 基座</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4285">71:25</a> 御碑亭</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4307">71:47</a> 五贤堂</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4360">72:40</a> 望苏台</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4484">74:44</a> 大雄宝殿</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4650">77:30</a> 花雨亭</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4680">78:00</a> 养鹤涧</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4750">79:10</a> 孙武练兵场</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4850">80:50</a> 万景山庄</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4935">82:15</a> 松风明月厅</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5035">83:55</a> 万松堂</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5210">86:50</a> 亦山亦水</span><br><span><a c