  <item>
    <title>Vol1.盘门 盘一盘苏州城的历史</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/668181e1cdd230b23b46caf5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">668181e1cdd230b23b46caf5</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jul 2024 02:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>各位听众大家好，欢迎收听“声动”的第一期节目。“声动”将会通过每一期节目的形式带大家深度游览城市的宝藏线路。</span></p><span></span><p><span>跟随“声动”的脚步一起，探索历史遗迹和博物馆，深度探寻每座城市独有的魅力。边听边看，边走边学～</span></p><span></span><p><span>本集内容我们将为您介绍盘门景区以及苏州城2500年的历史故事。来到苏州的朋友们可以来到盘门景区边游览边听我们的讲解，或者坐在吴门桥上来收听我们带来的故事。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>主要内容</span></strong><span>：盘门三景、苏州城的历史</span></p><span></span><p><span>ps：盘门景区有CBC冠军孙磊老师的咖啡店哦，叫马路咖啡～</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/luITt7KZ-tvZMoBSydP6_xDLv36N.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>本集内容时常：30分钟</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间线</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="104">01:44</a> 盘门水陆城门</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="165">02:45</a> 吴门桥</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="360">06:00</a> 泰伯庙</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="445">07:25</a> 鱼肠剑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="460">07:40</a> 吴王阖闾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="495">08:15</a> 苏州三双城市布局</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="540">09:00</a> 干将莫邪剑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="740">12:20</a> 卧薪尝胆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="860">14:20</a> 三国东吴时期</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="905">15:05</a> 隋唐时期</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1029">17:09</a> 宋元时期</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1167">19:27</a> 苏州的水</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1422">23:42</a> 苏州的文化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1578">26:18</a> 苏州的园子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1630">27:10</a> 苏州的工艺</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1738">28:58</a> 苏州就是没有机场</span></p><span></span><h2><span>吴门三景：</span></h2><span></span><p><span>水陆城门（图片来源于苏州文旅微博）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgp1QGc4j69RzcK8j_Xzy8dllSoo.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>西游记中取景处也是这个城门</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmS9XPKFJ68s1dbwmYi8YtflVAPF.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>吴门桥（图片来源于苏州文旅微博）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvGUUnmFgUR0xKwQc1GGptMujxf0.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>瑞光塔</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lqyIrQWrZFN5E71j6joTEDVFtu7D.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>预告：下一期为您带来的是吴中第一山——虎丘</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgievgdX8i6Cu3whOOrv0zG-8_PV.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsI9goD_ZaaksT6ut5W1K1bPCWQX.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>讲解老师：严巍</span></p><span></span><p><span>同游人：Chay 播客主理人</span></p><span></span><p><span>设计同学：粥一</span></p><span></span><p><span>联系微信：shallowers（备注收听平台）</span></p>]]></description>
